<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Aspect Development started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Aspect Development started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities Inc said Thursday it initiated coverage of Aspect Development Inc with an outperform rating for the intermediate and long term.</p>
<p>-- EVEREN said it also established earnings estimates for Aspect Development of $0.35 a share for 1997 and $0.56 for 1998. It also set an intermediate price target of $34 and a long-term price target of $49.</p>
<p>-- The market for Aspect Development's software and data products management services is growing and there are only two major competitors, EVEREN said.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were trading up 1-1/4 Thursday afternoon at 30-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
